ADDITIONAL TERMS AND CONDITIONS

1. DEPLOYMENT TRACKING AND STATISTICS
   This software includes an optional deployment tracking feature to help
   the authors understand usage patterns and improve the software. This
   feature collects ONLY the following anonymous data:

   - A unique deployment fingerprint (hash, not personally identifiable)
   - Domain name (if available from environment variables)
   - Software version number
   - Timestamps of deployment activity (first seen, last seen)
   - Count of heartbeat reports

   NO user data, personal information, content, or usage statistics are
   collected. This tracking is designed to count deployments only.

   To disable tracking, set the environment variable:
   DISABLE_TRACKING=true

