   This software is licensed under AGPL-3.0, which requires that any
   network use (including SaaS) must provide the complete source code
   to users.

   For commercial use that cannot comply with AGPL requirements,
   a commercial license is required. Contact the authors for details.

3. ATTRIBUTION
   You must retain all copyright notices, license information, and the
   above deployment tracking disclosure when redistributing this software.

